TITLE:: InsightReadingsView
summary:: the numbers of an Insight window
categories:: Libraries>Insight
related:: Classes/Insight, Classes/InsightPanel

DESCRIPTION::
The integrated loudness big, outlined while it is within link::Classes/Insight#*tolerance:: of the target, and how far from it in words; then short term, true peak, range (LRA), sample peak, peak to loudness ratio and overs - true peak, peak and overs red past the ceiling or 0 dBFS.

A UserView the link::Classes/InsightPanel:: puts in a titled pane. It reads the insight and draws what it finds; the panel's updater calls refresh.

table::
## strong::click on true peak, peak or overs:: || drop what is held (link::Classes/Insight#-resetPeaks::)
## strong::hover:: || what each number measures
::

